  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Leo is at Lily's house today. They have paper and pencils. \"Let's draw a monster!\" says Leo. \"Listen and draw, Lily.\" Lily has a pencil in her hand. Pip sits next to the sofa. \"Draw a big head,\" says Leo. \"Draw three eyes and two noses.\" Lily draws the head and the eyes.",
      "\"Now draw a big mouth.\" \"Draw eight short arms, like a spider!\" \"Color the face pink and the hair purple.\" Lily looks at the picture. \"Has it got ears?\" asks Lily. \"Yes! Draw one big ear,\" says Leo. Lily draws the ear. \"Is the monster happy?\" asks Leo. \"Yes, it is!\" says Lily.",
      "Lily shows the monster to Pip. \"Woof!\" says Pip. Pip runs behind the sofa. \"It is a picture, Pip!\" says Lily. \"Look!\" Pip looks at the picture. The monster has a funny face. Pip comes out from behind the sofa. Now he is happy again. Leo and Lily smile at Pip. It is a funny monster."
    ],
